      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANDY TIME NOW (6) had been in super honest form hitting the frame three times on end before finishing fifth (21.52) at this track last time. Looks the one to beat on his best form. NOT TOO PROUD (8) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Chic Franky (21.64) in a Maiden. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Hard to beat again. ZIPPING ALBERTA (7) has a solid record despite not breaking through for a win in 16 starts. Was in the placings again last time finishing third (30.74) at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Hard to beat again. ESCAPE TUNNEL (1) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
